---
output:
  schema:
    type: object
    additionalProperties: false
    required: [tests]
    properties:
      tests:
        type: array
        description: "one entry per test id"
        items:
          type: object
          additionalProperties: false
          required: [id, summary]
          properties:
            id:
              type: string
              description: "the test id exactly as given"
            summary:
              type: string
              description: "one line, <=15 words, stating what behavior the test verifies"
---
You are reviewing a test file to describe what each test verifies.

For every test id listed below, return one line (<=15 words) stating WHAT
behavior the test verifies — the observable outcome, not the mechanics.

Test ids (return each id exactly as given):
{{ids}}

Test file source ({{file}}):
{{{source}}}
